      "statement": "The console keeps a global MCP registry at state.mcp.servers (Record<string, McpServerDef>) persisted in .agents/console/state.json, where each McpServerDef carries name, transport (stdio {command, args?, env?} or http {url, headers?}), a global enabled toggle, and optional runtimeOverrides per runtime.",
