      "id": "claim_229fa75c3b6b4736ba406eb4ffef74cf",
      "statement": "syncMcp iterates five fixed targets: project (<repo>/.mcp.json, key mcpServers), claude-user (claude CLI at user scope with ~/.claude.json merge fallback), codex-global (~/.codex/config.toml), cursor-global (~/.cursor/mcp.json), and opencode-global (~/.config/opencode/opencode.jsonc, key mcp); ZCode and Kimi have no global MCP config and are covered only by the project target.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/console/src/core/mcp/sync.ts",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:3136f40f1616f02f3939125a39287e2d33c50b56db98a81a56a96e7d1490d280"
        }
