      "statement": "Entry rendering is centralized in stdioOrHttp: http becomes {type:\"http\", url, ...headers} for mcpServers-style targets or {type:\"remote\", url} for OpenCode (headers dropped there and in Codex TOML); stdio becomes {type:\"stdio\", command, args?, env?} or OpenCode's {type:\"local\", ...}, omitting args/env when empty.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/console/src/core/mcp/sync.ts",
